# Lead → Launch — Environment Variables Example
# Copy this to .env.local for local dev, or add to Vercel dashboard for production.

# ─── YOUR VERCEL APP URL (REQUIRED for live client demo links) ────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app

# ─── RECOMMENDED FREE: SerpAPI (100 real Google Maps searches/month, FREE) ───
# Get your free key at: https://serpapi.com — 100 searches/month free forever.
# SERPAPI_API_KEY=

# ─── OPTIONAL: Gemini Free Tier (adds AI quality boost, still 100% free) ──────
# Get yours at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ─── OPTIONAL: Apify (for live Google Maps scraping) ──────────────────────────
# Get free tokens at: https://apify.com (free plan = 5 scrapes/mo)
# APIFY_TOKEN=
# APIFY_ACTOR=compass~crawler-google-places

# ─── Leave all blank to run 100% free with local engine ───────────────────────
